(19, '3bf1a678-63f5-4c22-bf7a-a019d0ca1cdf', 12, 'Privacy Policy', 'privacy-policy', 'en', '{\"title\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"image_url\":\"\",\"index\":\"index\"}', '{\"2\":{\"section_type\":\"optional_content_section\",\"fields\":{\"content\":\"<h2><span style=\\\"font-size: 12pt;\\\">Privacy Policy<\\/span><\\/h2>\\r\\n<h3>1. Introduction<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span>Welcome to <strong>smarStore<\\/strong>! We value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This page explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal data.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>2. Information We Collect<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span>We may collect the following types of information:<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><span><strong>Personal Information<\\/strong>: Your name, email address, home address that you provide to us.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><span><strong>Non-Personal Information<\\/strong>: Browser type, IP address, access date and time, the name of the accessed file, and information from the website you came from.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3>3. Purpose of Information Collection<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span>We collect this information to:<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><span>Provide services and products to you.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><span>Improve user experience on our website.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><span>Ensure system security and stability.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><span>Perform administrative and management tasks.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3>4. Use of Information<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span>We use this information to:<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><span>Send emails related to our services and products.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><span>Provide customer support.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>\\r\\n<p><span>Conduct research and analysis to improve our services.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<h3>5. Information Security<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span>We implement security measures to protect your personal information from breaches, unauthorized access, and cyber attacks. However, we do not guarantee complete security against all risks.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>6. Your Rights<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span>You have the right to request your personal information to be updated, modified, or deleted. You also have the right to opt-out of our collection and use of your personal information.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>7. Changes to This Policy<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span>We may update this policy from time to time. You should review this policy periodically to stay informed of any changes.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<h3>8. Contact Us<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><span>If you have any questions about this privacy policy or our data collection and use practices, please contact us at: [email@example.com].<\\/span><\\/p>\"}}}', ''),
